+           row  `RepetitionTooLarge`  17  _the number of repetitions exceeds the limit of 1000_  un número mayor que `Motif.maxRepetition`, o un programa mayor que `Motif.Program.maxOps`
+           row  `BudgetExceeded`  18  _the analysis exceeded its computation budget_  un análisis de contención que pasa de `Subsumption.maxStates`
